'''Tinkaton ex''' (Japanese: '''デカヌチャンex''' ''Dekanuchan ex'') is a {{ct|Metal}} Stage 2 {{TCGP|Pokémon ex}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Shining Revelry}} expansion.

